        "/^for title in 'M0: Feasibility gates' 'M1: Protocol kernel and CLI skeleton' 'M2: Hedera testnet transport' 'M3: Browser approval handoff' 'M4: World production verification' 'M5: Initial ballot capability slice' 'M6: Ballot lifecycle and deterministic result' 'M7: Cloud Run and durable projection' 'M8: Product expansion'; do gh api --method POST repos/rtree/oshikatsu/milestones -f title=\"\\$title\" -f description=\"Acceptance-evidence milestone governed by software-design/sdd\\.md Part III\\.\" --silent; done\nfor spec in 'spike:B60205:Time-boxed external feasibility test' 'protocol:5319E7:Canonical protocol and domain behavior' 'hedera:1F883D:Hedera network integration' 'world-id:2D9CDB:World ID and World Chain integration' 'api:0E8A16:Cloud Run API and application use cases' 'cli:006B75:Headless CLI and orchestration' 'evidence:C2E0C6:Real-network acceptance evidence' 'blocked:B91C1C:Blocked by an external prerequisite' 'risk:D93F0B:Architecture or schedule risk'; do name=\\$\\{spec%%:\\*\\}; rest=\\$\\{spec#\\*:\\}; color=\\$\\{rest%%:\\*\\}; description=\\$\\{rest#\\*:\\}; gh label create \"\\$name\" --repo rtree/oshikatsu --color \"\\$color\" --description \"\\$description\" --force; done$/": {
